Spec: Local visitor permission command verification

Purpose:
  Verify owners can inspect, approve, recover and retire exact visitor permissions with the actual console program.

Owns:
  ./OwnerAccessCliTests.cs

Must:
  Use a private owned fixture and actual argument-list subprocess execution without changing installed services.
  Cover bounded request/grant listing, proposal-before-approval, retained results, stale permission inspection/revocation and rejection of unknown proposal fields.
